"ONB_P2_TITLE" = "Split the car screen";
"ONB_P2_BODY" = "• In the car, tap the OmniCar button on the CarPlay dock to open the layout panel.\n• Pick a layout: 2 panes, 3 panes, 1 large + 2 or 2 + 1 large. Then pick the apps.\n• Or long-press an app icon on the car home screen to split with that app.\n• Drag the round knob to resize. The Home button exits split.";
"ONB_P2_NOTE" = "Save your go-to layouts in Split Screen > Favorite layouts.";

"ONB_P3_TITLE" = "Speed Bubble";
"ONB_P3_BODY" = "A small bubble on the car screen shows your speed and the speed limit, so you see it at a glance.";
"ONB_P3_SWITCH" = "Speed Bubble";
"ONB_P3_NOTE" = "Needs Vietmap Live or GOFA on your iPhone. Pick the source in the Speed Bubble page.";

"ONB_P4_TITLE" = "Quick tips";
"ONB_P4_BODY" = "• Layout panel: tap the OmniCar button on the CarPlay dock, or long-press an app icon.\n• Recent and Favorites are in the same panel.\n• Something wrong? Open Support at the bottom of this page: Send log sends a report to the developer.";
"ONB_P4_NOTE" = "You can open this guide again from Support > Show guide again.";
